.TH SANCHALA-FOCUS-MODE 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-focus-mode \- Distraction-free productivity mode
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-focus-mode
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Block distractions and enable Do Not Disturb for focused work sessions.
Supports Pomodoro technique and custom focus modes.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B start \fI[mode]\fR
Start focus session (work, study, meeting, personal)
.TP
.B stop
End current focus session
.TP
.B toggle
Toggle focus mode on/off
.TP
.B status
Show current focus status
.TP
.B pomodoro
Start a 25-minute Pomodoro session
.TP
.B modes
List available focus modes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-duration \fIminutes\fR
Set custom duration for focus session
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Start work focus:
.B sanchala-focus-mode start work
.TP
Start 45-minute session:
.B sanchala-focus-mode start -d 45
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
